cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "TruthBench"
abstract: >-
  TruthBench is a framework for meta-evaluating factuality metrics through
  controlled, graded perturbation of ground-truth answers. It ships alongside
  truthscore, an LLM+NLI factual-correctness metric implemented as a separate
  package and evaluated with TruthBench like any other metric.
